   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ HYBRID + LoRA\n\nComposition: first model (pose, body, framing) with ITS LoRA stack.\nRefinement: second model (skin, hair, fabric) with its own.\n\nThe text goes through the COMPOSITION stack: that one decides the scene.\nA style LoRA belongs on composition, a skin/detail LoRA on refinement.\n\nThe (auto) profile is the one of the composition model.\nCareful: a LoRA trained on base Krea 2 may behave oddly on a fine-tune,\nand vice versa. Try them one at a time."
   ],
